sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant P as PRS Server
    participant R as Receiver

    Note over C: 1. BSN afschermen<br/>PersonalId JSON · HKDF(org|scope|v1)<br/>pyoprf.blind() → blind_factor + blinded_input

    C->>P: POST /oprf/eval<br/>{encryptedPersonalId, recipientOrganization…}

    Note over P: 2. Evalueren + versleutelen<br/>pyoprf.evaluate(server_key, blinded_input)<br/>JWE aanmaken - pub key van Receiver<br/>(client ziet nooit de serversleutel)

    P-->>C: { jwe: "eyJ…" }

    Note over C: 3. Doorsturen naar Receiver<br/>client kan JWE niet lezen

    C->>R: { blind_factor, jwe }

    Note over R: 4. Ontsleutelen + unblinden<br/>JWE ontsleutelen met private key<br/>pyoprf.unblind(blind_factor, eval)<br/>→ definitief pseudoniem
